@ZacksJerryRig @Rivian Bro, just get a good battery from any of the auto parts places, or Walmart, or Costco. Choose your category (like premium, if desired). 

Seriously, it’s just a 12v auto battery. It’ll be fine, and you won’t be robbed. 

Let us know how it works out.

