Y el precio... Costco VS Repsol -0.3/-0.5c/L (Zaragoza).

@MdBreathe Costco sells organic tallow, great for frying steaks.

You do know that we've been lied to about fats, right? You know that butter, lard and tallow are actually good for us, right?
