@Costco_human こんにちは。いつも情報ありがとうございます。参考にさせていただいております。
最近発売になったブルガリアヨーグルトあじわい芳醇ですが、クーポン期間の土曜日午後には品切れで買えず…
基本的にはレア品ということもなく、ヨーグルト売り場にあるでしょうか？

@nick_plaid @DirtyTesLa I’ve got like 5 drones, I fly them for a living. 
It’s hard to incorporate them into FSD videos though, I’ve tried in the past. 
Maybe I’ll put it up near Costco now that I’m doing more parking lot centric driving.

@TrumpIsBack7 @RepMTG I’d prefer somebody who follows a moral code over whatever the party tells them to follow.

It’s not healthy to agree just because you carry the same “membership card”. 

Ex: You can go to Costco and say “I don’t really like the fruit here, I prefer Sam’s” and THAT’S OK!!!
